@anon.984efe779a4077b66be6415f964eeb42.2169 = private unnamed_addr constant <{ [423 x i8] }> <{ [423 x i8] c"The title of the bibliography.\0A\0A- When set to `{auto}`, an appropriate title for the\0A  [text language]($text.lang) will be used. This is the default.\0A- When set to `{none}`, the bibliography will not have a title.\0A- A custom title can be set by passing content.\0A\0AThe bibliography's heading will not be numbered by default, but you can\0Aforce it to be with a show-set rule:\0A`{show bibliography: set heading(numbering: \221.\22)}`" }>, align 1
